Bundle-Name: Gecko Weather API
Bundle-Description: Consumer-facing services (site registry, weather service with report and value \
	queries by site id), the repository boundary, the solar service and the provider SPI. \
	Provider-neutral; no vendor name appears in any type.

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.gecko.weather.model;version=snapshot

-testpath: \
	assertj-core;version=latest
